      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "<ol>\n<li>Let my master, h[is Rock] p[reserve him], please copy this letter in a beautiful handwriting, and diligently</li>\n<li>follow my handwriting, which is to be copied, lest he write something</li>\n<li>incorrect (or: objectionable) and the letter go to waste. May his peace increase.&nbsp;</li>\n</ol>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
